#####
##### Web sidecar: image proxy (/api/proxy) vs Next.js Image Optimization (/_next/image)
#####
# Optional booleans: "true" or "false" if set. Leave blank for defaults (both off).
# Distinct flags: proxy rewrites remote URLs to same-origin; optimizer uses Next's image pipeline.
NEXT_PUBLIC_IMAGE_PROXY_ENABLED=
NEXT_PUBLIC_NEXT_IMAGE_OPTIMIZATION_ENABLED=
